    "case_for": "I retain B008 as my preferred configuration. Optical lattice clocks have become a reproducible measurement capability at extraordinary precision, with independent implementations and sustained gains demonstrating maturity. Their use in tests of fundamental physics and measurements of gravitational potential gives the achievement scientific reach beyond timekeeping. The citation recognizes clock development as a precision measurement method, rather than a single record or all of optical metrology.",
